Spec: Pending permission request verification

Purpose:
  Verify the request boundary through private SQLite, actual pipes and the independent SDK.

Owns:
  ./PendingGrantTests.cs

Must:
  Remove newer connection journals when constructing older schema fixtures; migration must not invent flows or attachments.
  Remove newer access tables when constructing historical schema fixtures and verify the current schema version after migration.
  Cover strict values, explicit opt-in, approved-import requirements, foreign application/request rejection and policy injection.
  Verify approval-version binding, supersession, old-result replay, migration, quotas, rollback and concurrent same-operation submission.
  Exercise SDK unknown-outcome recovery and host inspection without enabling any transport or active grant.
